fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth265parser.html#GstH265TimeCode","fragment":"\n\tGstH265TimeCode\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265TimeCode\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265TimeCode\n\nMembers\nThe time code SEI message provides time code information similar to that\ndefined by SMPTE ST 12-1 (2014) for field(s) or frame(s) of the current\npicture.\nThe time code SEI message provides time code information similar to that\ndefined by SMPTE ST 12-1 (2014) for field(s) or frame(s) of the current\npicture.\nThe time code SEI message provides time code information similar to that\ndefined by SMPTE ST 12-1 (2014) for field(s) or frame(s) of the current\npicture.\n"});